    "The collector should acknowledge a click and hand it off. To what?",
    "38,000 clicks/s must be aggregated with headroom for spikes. Size the workers and the store for that.",
    "LB (3) → collectors (40) → Kinesis → aggregators (26) → InfluxDB (4); dashboards read through Redis."
