  "explanation": [
    "Write clicks to a durable stream with a click id; aggregators deduplicate by id so retries never double-bill.",
    "Aggregate per minute in the stream workers and store the results in a time-series database: dashboards then read tiny pre-aggregated rows.",
    "Keep raw clicks in cheap storage for audits and to recompute if an aggregation bug is found."
  ]
